Voici un pavé droit.

```solide
forme: pave {{l}} {{p}} {{h}}
cotes: cm
```

Lequel de ces dessins est un patron de ce pavé ?

````choix
- ```patron
  solide: pave {{l}} {{p}} {{h}}
  forme: {{f}}
  cotes: cm
  ```
- ```patron
  solide: pave {{l}} {{eval:p+1}} {{h}}
  forme: {{f}}
  cotes: cm
  ```
- ```patron
  solide: pave {{l}} {{p}} {{h}}
  forme: faux {{m}}
  cotes: cm
  ```
````
